{
  "name": "career-one",
  "version": "1.1.0-beta.4",
  "description": "择程AI：面向中国大陆用户的本地优先 AI 求职工作台，可由 Codex、Claude Code、OpenCode、TRAE 等 Agent 驱动",
  "private": true,
